fect place to study and enjoy college life. Learn More About Campus Life Earn a degree & Start your career Remarkable Outcomes Brevard graduates excel in every field: CEOs of Fortune 500 companies, entrepreneurs, medical professionals, and C-suite executives, to name a few. Explore Graduate Profiles Explore Campus and the Land of Waterfalls Visit Brevard! Take a campus tour and learn more about Brevard. The next Open House event is Saturday, September 26! (You can also choose a date that fits your schedule!) Register for an Open House! You are more than a test score. Apply for Admission You can choose to apply test-optional. The application is free and serves as your Merit Scholarship application! Apply for Admission! One Brevard College Dr. Brevard, NC 28712 828.641.0641 admissions@brevard.edu (opens in new tab) (opens in new tab) (opens in new tab) Brevard College is consistently recognized as one of the best liberal arts colleges. The College's focus on experiential learning, small class sizes, and location in the mountains of Western North Carolina near Asheville make Brevard a top choice college for students around the world. Consumer Disclosure Terms of Use Title IX Privacy Policy Whistleblower Policy MyBrevard © 2026 Brevard College This institution is an equal opportunity provider. Want to learn more? Sign up to download our quick fact sheet & stay up to date with Brevard College! Footer Interest Capture First Name * Last Name * Email * Graduating Year * If you are human, leave this field blank. Request Δ"
